213
00:11:15,008 --> 00:11:16,809
Food Facts!

214
00:11:21,281 --> 00:11:22,882
Mung beans are plant seeds

215
00:11:22,882 --> 00:11:25,418
Give them enough sunlight, air, and water,

216
00:11:25,418 --> 00:11:26,753
